---
// HomeFinalCTA.astro - Conversion finale unique et percutante
---

<section id="contact" class="my-14 sm:my-20 rounded-3xl bg-gray-950 text-white p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 border border-gray-800 text-center" aria-labelledby="final-cta-heading">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <p class="text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest text-xs font-semibold">
      Premier pas
    </p>

    <h2 id="final-cta-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-serif font-medium text-white mt-2 leading-tight">
      Envie d'essayer la calligraphie chinoise ?
    </h2>

    <p class="text-stone-300 font-serif text-base sm:text-lg mt-4 leading-relaxed">
      Écrivez à Christophe pour poser une question, réserver un premier atelier ou discuter d'une œuvre.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3.5">
      <a
        href="mailto:christophe.desmur@orange.fr?subject=Contact%20calligraphie%20chinoise"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white text-sm font-medium transition shadow-md focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white">
        Contacter Christophe
      </a>

      <a
        href="/cours-collectifs"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white text-sm font-medium transition border border-white/20 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white">
        Voir les cours
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
